OL,3,GNEWSAGreen deputy leader questioned on
OL,4,Asmall boats and polling on BBC local
OL,5,Aradio
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreen Party deputy Rachel Millward
OL,8,Ftells BBC Radio Hereford & Worcester
OL,9,Fher party has had an "absolutely
OL,10,Fhistoric successful year" and defends
OL,11,Fparty leader Zack Polanski's recent
OL,12,Fdrop in polling
OL,14,FOn small boats, she tells Radio Solent
OL,15,F"more safe routes" are needed so people
OL,16,Fcan seek asylum in a "sensible measured
OL,17,Fway"
OL,19,FMeanwhile, she tells Radio Kent that PM
OL,20,FAndy Burnham has been "very vague" on
OL,21,Fhow he plans to tackle failing water
OL,22,Fcompanies
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
