OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGreen deputy leader questioned on
OL,4,Asmall boats and polling on BBC local
OL,5,Aradio
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe also criticises Reform UK, telling
OL,8,FRadio Newcastle it is "nonsense" that
OL,9,Fthey represent ordinary people
OL,11,FAsked about the latest position on
OL,12,FBirmingham's bin strike, Millward says
OL,13,F"I haven't got the information. I'm so
OL,14,Fsorry". The Greens have run the council
OL,15,Fwith the Lib Dems and independents
OL,16,Fsince May
OL,18,FShe has just finished seven quick-fire
OL,19,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,20,Fas her party prepares to host its
OL,21,Fautumn conference in Brighton from
OL,22,FFriday
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
